{"id":"sou","lemma":"sou","pos":"noun","rank":3134,"glosses":["sou (old French coin)","money; cash"],"ipa":"/su/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/Fr-sou.ogg/Fr-sou.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sous"},"formAudio":{"sous":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-sous.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ça ne vaut pas un sou.","en":"It isn't worth a dime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102866","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be worth","l":"valoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'étais sans le sou.","en":"I was broke.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/474748","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je suis complètement sans le sou.","en":"I don't have a penny to my name.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Cache-le sous le lit.","en":"Hide it under the bed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103058","words":[{"g":"to hide","l":"cacher"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bed"}]},{"text":"Je pensais que vous étiez sans le sou.","en":"I thought you were broke.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}